1
00:00:14,424 --> 00:00:17,900
Tu veux vivre près de la mer un jour ?
Do you want to live near the sea one day?

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,532
Oui, j’aime entendre les vagues et rêver du soleil.
Yes, I like hearing the waves and dreaming about the sun.

3
00:00:22,632 --> 00:00:27,596
Tu souris déjà ! Ta blague me fait rire.
You’re already smiling! Your joke makes me laugh.

4
00:00:27,696 --> 00:00:31,004
Et cette chanson me plaît beaucoup.
And I like this song a lot.

5
00:00:31,104 --> 00:00:35,108
Appuie sur ce bouton, s’il te plaît.
Press this button, please.

6
00:00:35,208 --> 00:00:39,788
D’accord. Une minute suffit ?
Okay. Is one minute enough?

7
00:00:39,888 --> 00:00:44,180
Oui, et après, on s’amuse au parc.
Yes, and afterward, we’ll have fun at the park.

8
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:49,652
Super ! La fête dure jusqu’à huit heures.
Great! The party lasts until eight o’clock.
